{"slug":"apple-watch","title":"Apple Watch Personal Security App","desc":"Transform your Apple Watch into a personal SOS alarm using Peoplesafe: the first, and only, professional personal safety app to be available on this product.","og":"https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/Apple-watch-hero.png","content":"<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/hero {\"label\":\"Personal Security App\",\"title\":\"Apple Watch Personal Security App\",\"intro\":\"\",\"buttons\":[{\"linkText\":\"Book a Demo\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"dialog\":\"demo-dialog\",\"variant\":\"\"},{\"linkText\":\"Get a Quote\",\"link\":\"/uk/get-your-quote/\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"dialog\":\"\",\"variant\":\"outline\"}],\"imageId\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/Apple-watch-hero.png@@\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/trustpilot-widget {\"widget\":\"horizontal\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/top-tabs {\"tabs\":[{\"title\":\"SOS alarm\",\"icon\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/SOS-Alarm.png@@\",\"iconUrl\":\"\",\"preTitle\":\"Help available 24/7\",\"heading\":\"SOS alarm\",\"content\":\"Receive emergency help faster than 999 with direct access to police control rooms.\",\"linkText\":\"Book a Demo\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/Apple-watch-tab1.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"Wearable technology\",\"icon\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/wearable-tech-icon.png@@\",\"iconUrl\":\"\",\"preTitle\":\"Instant access\",\"heading\":\"Wearable technology\",\"content\":\"Call for help without accessing your iPhone.\",\"linkText\":\"Book a Demo\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/Apple-watch-tab2.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"Speech recognition\",\"icon\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/audio.png@@\",\"iconUrl\":\"\",\"preTitle\":\"Hands-free\",\"heading\":\"Speech recognition\",\"content\":\"Hands-free operation using speech-to-text for faster transcription of activities and messages.\",\"linkText\":\"Book a Demo\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/Apple-watch-tab3.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"Welfare check\",\"icon\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/welfare-check-icon.png@@\",\"iconUrl\":\"\",\"preTitle\":\"Safety confirmations\",\"heading\":\"Welfare check\",\"content\":\"Wearers can periodically confirm they are ok during an activity. When a 'no' answer is recorded, an alarm is automatically raised.\",\"linkText\":\"Book a Demo\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/Apple-watch-tab4.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"Configurable\",\"icon\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/config-icon.png@@\",\"iconUrl\":\"\",\"preTitle\":\"Pro and SOS available\",\"heading\":\"Configurable\",\"content\":\"Both the lone worker app and personal safety app from Peoplesafe are available on the Apple Watch.\",\"linkText\":\"Book a Demo\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"image\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/Apple-watch-tab5.png@@\",\"imageUrl\":\"\"}]} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media {\"title\":\"Emergency response faster than 999\",\"mediaType\":\"video\",\"videoUrl\":\"https://vimeo.com/841920708\"} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Your employees are protected 24/7/365 by our dedicated <a href=\"/uk/alarm-receiving-centre/\">Alarm Receiving Centre (ARC)</a>. We provide the quickest response in an emergency.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>3 seconds to pick up alarms</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>4 minute police response in threat-to-life situations</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>100% service uptime</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n<!-- /wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media -->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media {\"title\":\"24/7 personal safety\",\"imageId\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/Apple-watch-tab5.png@@\",\"framed\":false,\"mediaPosition\":\"left\"} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Paired with your iPhone, the Apple Watch with <a href=\"/uk/product/ps-pro-app/\">Peoplesafe</a> downloaded becomes an emergency response tool that can get help to the wearer faster than dialling 999.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Pressing the <a href=\"/uk/products/mysos/\">SOS button</a> via the Apple Watch initiates a call to the dedicated Peoplesafe ARC. A two-way audio communication channel can be established directly with the Apple Watch or on the paired iPhone.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Having this peace of mind on your wrist offers reassurance for you and your loved ones, whether at work, engaged in outdoor activities or travelling. In situations where your iPhone is not easily accessible, or you’re unable to use it due to injury or distress, calling for help quickly and easily from your Apple Watch is invaluable.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Compatible with Apple Watch Series 8 or later.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- /wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media -->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media {\"title\":\"Download Brochure\",\"buttons\":[{\"linkText\":\"Download Product Brochure\",\"link\":\"https://insights.peoplesafe.co.uk/story/product-brochure/page/11/?teaser=yes\",\"linkTarget\":true,\"dialog\":\"\",\"variant\":\"outline\"}],\"imageId\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/product-brochure-turtl.jpg@@\",\"framed\":false} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Want to learn more about how the Peoplesafe app on Apple Watches can enhance the safety and security of lone workers?</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Download our comprehensive product brochure for detailed information on its features and benefits.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Discover how Apple Watches can offer reliable protection and rapid response to ensure your employees are protected in situations where they don’t have access to their iPhones.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://insights.peoplesafe.co.uk/story/product-brochure/page/11/?teaser=yes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Download Product Brochure</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- /wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media -->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/cta-banner {\"theme\":\"orange\",\"title\":\"See how it works\",\"content\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eTo get an Apple Watch demo, contact our experts using the form below.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/form {\"formUrl\":\"https://safe.peoplesafe.co.uk/l/830213/2024-07-17/2jjffk\",\"height\":550} /-->","menu_order":8,"types":["safety-apps"]}